    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unemployed</strong>, <strong>unskilled</strong>, and <strong>broke</strong>, you\u2019re backed against the wall. To avoid ending up on the street, you need to <strong>take action</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up at 7 a.m., you decide to sign up on an online platform \u2014 <strong>Job at Risk</strong> \u2014 and look for a training course to start shaping your <strong>professional future</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the jobs offered here aren\u2019t like any others. These are tasks <strong>nobody</strong> wants to take\u2026 Will you rise to the <strong>challenge</strong> and uncover the <strong>secrets</strong> they hide?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character and assign <strong>attributes</strong> that can be useful depending on the <strong>mission</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/extras/6ce6e2e48e57eef52da436756dbde99b.avif?t=1754433783\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate\u00a0in <strong>training</strong> <strong>courses</strong> to acquire <strong>skills</strong> and unlock new jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apply</strong>, attend <strong>interviews</strong>, and become the <strong>model employee</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your <strong>skills</strong> to finally <strong>break free</strong> from your boss and become <strong>independent</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/extras/7d91e726cabbb45f4d0733becf46d072.avif?t=1754433783\" /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate <strong>goal</strong>: achieve <strong>financial freedom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get there, you\u2019ll need <strong>professionalism</strong>, <strong>patience</strong>, and <strong>courage</strong>. Every job hides a <strong>mysterious</strong> story, which you\u2019ll have to dare to discover\u2026 sometimes even against your will.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/extras/ec7f1fa6bd47db0f9bf2d6ec1cc5540e.avif?t=1754433783\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job at Risk</strong> is waiting for you. Are you ready to take on the <strong>adventure</strong>?</p>",
